  "title": "15 February 1965: John Lennon passes his driving test",
  "date": "1965-02-15",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Prior to the <a href=\"/1965/02/15/recording-ticket-to-ride-another-girl-i-need-you/\">first recording session</a> for <a href=\"/albums/help/\">Help!</a> that afternoon, <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> passed his driving test in Weybridge, the town where he lived. <span id=\"more-4413\"></span></p><p>Lennon was a notoriously bad driver, and rarely drove himself after passing his test. The other Beatles had learnt to drive previously, and were keen drivers, but Lennon’s confidence was knocked after crashing his car shortly after this date.</p><p>He was normally chauffeured to recording sessions and appointments by his driver, Les Anthony, and on the occasions when Lennon did drive, he was often inattentive to other cars and navigated roads poorly.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/02/15/john-lennon-passes-driving-test/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-4413 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1965-photos/650215-john-lennon_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon on the day he passed his driving test, 15 February 1965\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-960x953.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-768x762.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27638\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1965-photos/650215-john-lennon_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1016\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon on the day he passed his driving test, 15 February 1965\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-john-lennon_01-960x953.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1965-photos/650215-beatles_07/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-200x140.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles on the day John Lennon passed his driving test, 15 February 1965\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-200x140.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-580x406.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-960x671.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-768x537.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"27637\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1965-photos/650215-beatles_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1280,895\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles on the day John Lennon passed his driving test, 15 February 1965\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650215-beatles_07-960x671.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"g